Check 3: allow-scripts policy
-----------------------------
video/storytime-song/package.json line 34 holds allowScripts
{"esbuild": false}. The phase diff of that file adds only the overrides
block at lines 40-42, so the deny is unchanged. The video hasInstallScript
set is still exactly {node_modules/esbuild}, so the only install script
the policy must block is still the one that is blocked. The user ~/.npmrc
holds an allow-scripts key. npm reported in the D2 evidence that it
ignores that key, because package.json declares its own allowScripts
field. dashboard/package.json has no allowScripts field at either end of
the diff, so this phase changed nothing there.

