Check 8: minimatch caret in video
---------------------------------
video/storytime-song/package.json line 41 holds minimatch ^11.0.9, and
the lockfile resolves 11.0.9 with integrity. The advisory
GHSA-g3hv-75wg-m249 covers 7.0.0 - 11.0.0. Every version the caret can
resolve to is 11.0.9 or higher, so the caret cannot pull a version inside
the vulnerable range. The lockfile pins 11.0.9, so npm ci installs that
exact version. A future fresh resolve could pull a later 11.x without a
review. The audit gate would report any advisory on it at the next
run. The caret matches the style of the kept dashboard overrides, so I
raise no finding on it.

